{
  "name": "17 · Resume Screener (Kaamchor AI · MAP 2.0 · Ops)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📄 Resume Screener\nA resume PDF lands in Gmail → text extracted → Claude scores it 0-10 against your job description → Shortlist / Reject row in Google Sheets.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Connect Gmail, Anthropic (Claude) and Google Sheets credentials.\n2. In **Claude scores resume**, edit the **job description** block.\n3. Make a Google Sheet with headers: Date, Name, Email, Phone, Experience, Skills, Score, Status, Reason, Subject, and pick it in the last node.\n4. Activate. Every resume PDF → score → Sheet.\n\nJudges only skills and experience. A human makes the final call.\n\n---\nPart of **MAP – 12 AI agents** (Kaamchor AI).",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "a5c94bce-b250-4f00-a641-00f5320092f1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": false,
        "filters": {
          "q": "has:attachment filename:pdf (resume OR CV OR application OR job)"
        },
        "options": {
          "downloadAttachments": true
        }
      },
      "id": "a553abc5-7ea5-4753-bccf-f6b10a603d32",
      "name": "Gmail – new resume",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        300,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "pdf",
        "binaryPropertyName": "attachment_0",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2e8a73a5-6b6b-42c2-8517-cf39e3534791",
      "name": "Read PDF text",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.extractFromFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        520,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert HR recruiter. Score this candidate's resume against the job description.\n\n=== EDIT THIS: JOB DESCRIPTION ===\nRole: Sales Executive\nMust have: 1+ years B2B / field sales, Excel, CRM (any), good communication (Hindi + English)\nNice to have: lead generation, cold calling, local market knowledge\nLocation: Pune (on-site)\n=== END ===\n\nRESUME TEXT:\n{{ $json.text }}\n\nReturn: candidate name, email, phone, total years of experience (number), top 5 relevant skills, a score from 0 to 10 for fit with the job, a one-line reason, and status = \"Shortlist\" if score >= 7 else \"Reject\". Be strict and fair; judge only on skills and experience.",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "03b0076c-ea28-4ef4-b4a5-3fb3a68aff9b",
      "name": "Claude scores resume",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        740,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "id": "bdfcf6c3-d353-4c17-97a8-d39a0695d4ff",
      "name": "Claude",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        700,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"name\": \"Rohan Verma\",\n  \"email\": \"candidate@example.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"+1 555 0100\",\n  \"experience_years\": 3,\n  \"skills\": [\n    \"B2B Sales\",\n    \"Excel\",\n    \"CRM\",\n    \"Cold calling\",\n    \"Lead generation\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 8.5,\n  \"reason\": \"3 yrs field B2B sales, CRM + Excel\",\n  \"status\": \"Shortlist\"\n}"
      },
